<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70556" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεφρ-ῑτῐκός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of the kidneys,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοσήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Art.</u>
					41
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ν.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Aph.</u>
					6.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>affected with</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεφρῖτις,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Apollon.
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.326
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>Nat.Fac.</u>
				1.13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> of
			remedies, <i>suitable for such cases,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Alex.Trall.
				11.2
			</span></i>.</div>
